  {
   "id": "railway-s11",
   "number": "11",
   "text": "(1) All work relating to railway works — including, but not limited to, design, construction, evaluation, maintenance and alteration — must be done in accordance with sound engineering principles. (2) All engineering work relating to railway works must be approved by a professional engineer.",
   "part": "PART I Construction or Alteration of Railway Works",
